          <a href="#what-to-buy" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. If You Are Shopping: What to Check Before You Order</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">11. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
