        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">The T Series is NordicTrack's walking and light-running tier;
            the Commercial series is its running tier.</strong> They share a 60-inch belt, a 12%
            incline ceiling, folding frames and iFIT. The Commercial series adds decline and a
            higher listed user rating, and the 1750 and 2450 add the lifetime motor warranty that
            is the real dividing line.
          </p>
